#: ../../source/docs/building-the-code-onlinux.rst:97
#: 0084addc5d2443048c599809ca331a21
msgid ""
"Once installed, you can build by changing directory to the vehicle type you "
"want to build for, and running 'make' with the target you want. Look in "
"mk/targets.mk for a list of build targets."
msgstr "安装完成后，切换到您要构建的车辆类型目录，并使用所需目标运行「make」即可进行构建。构建目标列表可参见 mk/targets.mk。"

