msgstr "在 Ubuntu 上为 APM1/APM2（Arduino）平台构建 ardupilot 需要以下软件包："

#: ../../source/docs/building-the-code-onlinux.rst:111
#: fff68d94a9254778a936e0bb8cdee511
msgid ""
"To build ardupilot for the PX4 platform, you'll first need to install the "
"PX4 toolchain and download the PX4 source code."
msgstr "要为 PX4 平台构建 ardupilot，首先需要安装 PX4 工具链并下载 PX4 源代码。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-the-code-onlinux.rst:114
#: 84c514e77d4f4a2e909eba568c30664d
msgid ""
"The easiest way to install all these prerequisites is to run the "
"**ardupilot/Tools/scripts/install-prereqs-ubuntu.sh** script, which will "
"install all the required packages and download all the required software."
msgstr ""
"安装所有这些前提条件最简便的方式是运行 **ardupilot/Tools/scripts/install-prereqs-ubuntu.sh** "
"脚本，该脚本会安装所有必要软件包并下载所有所需软件。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-the-code-onlinux.rst:117
#: ee0ea0f7e4a242d5abcdd9ece4b45e70
msgid "Building using make"
msgstr "使用 make 构建"

#: ../../source/docs/building-the-code-onlinux.rst:119
#: 82b92f8fef2345ba86da265d0d54a015
msgid ""
"1. For Copter and AntennaTracker you'll need to run ``make configure`` from "
"a sketch directory (ArduCopter or AntennaTracker) before you build the "
"project for the first time. This will create a **config.mk** file at the top"
" level of the repository. You can set some defaults in **config.mk**"
msgstr ""
"1. 对于 Copter 和 AntennaTracker，首次构建项目前需要在 sketch 目录（ArduCopter 或 "
"AntennaTracker）中运行 ``make configure``。这将在仓库顶层创建一个 **config.mk** 文件，您可以在 "
"**config.mk** 中设置一些默认值"

#: ../../source/docs/building-the-code-onlinux.rst:125
#: 77feeea44cef4211b98cb0b1e5e3e2bd
msgid ""
"2. In the sketch directory, type ``make`` to build for APM2. Alternatively, "
"``make apm1`` will build for the APM1 and \\`make px4\\` will build for the "
"Pixhawk. The binaries will generated in \\`/tmp/\\ *sketchname*.build\\`."
msgstr ""
"2. 在 sketch 目录中，输入 ``make`` 以为 APM2 构建。也可以用 ``make apm1`` 为 APM1 构建，用 "
"\\`make px4\\` 为 Pixhawk 构建。二进制文件将生成在 \\`/tmp/\\ *sketchname*.build\\` 中。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-the-code-onlinux.rst:130
#: 03c1167a2bb6492f8c29949895cb5782
msgid ""
"3. Type \\`make upload\\` to upload. You may need to set the correct default"
" serial port in your \\`config.mk\\`."
msgstr "3. 输入 \\`make upload\\` 进行上传。您可能需要在 \\`config.mk\\` 中设置正确的默认串口。"
